- Manage attendance for practices, games, and tournaments

At the start of the season, encourage parents to immediately:
- Download the TeamSnap app
- Make sure they can see your JYO team in the app
- Keep their availability updated regularly (any change within 24 hours of an event should also include a text to you, or your preferred method of immediate communication)

